---
description: Orbit framework coding checklist for contributors.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Follow root AGENTS.md conventions before introducing new patterns.
- Prefer app-facing imports from '@orbitstack/app' unless extending internals.
- Keep framework examples aligned with packages/example-notion.
- Validate actor wiring changes with 'orbitstack build --strict-wiring'.
- Keep docs and scaffold output synchronized when changing CLI behavior.
